c3.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is 'I, II, and III.'" 13194139534768 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-18d294d7-e90d-595c-8fa7-6170debebbf7" 17592186435505 "answer-519adb21-ac16-5108-9bc4-9df2a4611d46" 17592186435506 "answer-5629f73f-1165-5287-a036-29dde44376aa" 17592186435507 "answer-a0ee6fb8-0275-543e-9a03-ba5f9eb26748" 17592186435508 "answer-af171406-b374-5cc4-8490-0e1a9e1865ef" 17592186435509 "answer-field-e0d75057-311d-52aa-8f97-e8208efd3230" 17592186435510 "question-4212543c-3dc3-579d-b570-8f3b6f775fcc" 17592186435511} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
